{"availability":"available","full":"LancerLab/croqtile","name":"croqtile","description":"A Next-Gen AI-native Kernel programming DSL for Maximizing Productivity","category":"Productivity","language":"C++","stars":64,"forks":7,"created":"2026-01-27T03:47:08Z","updated":"2026-10-10T02:27:52Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://lancerlab.github.io/croqtile-website/en/","topics":["gpu-programming","high-performance-computing","large-language-model"],"demo":"https://lancerlab.github.io/croqtile-website/en/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T04:14:55.519Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T04:14:55.519Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T04:14:55.519Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T18:01:03.918Z","stars":64,"forks":7},{"at":"2026-10-13T04:14:55.519Z","stars":64,"forks":7}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Croqtile &mdash; The AI-Native GPU Kernel Programming Language","Website &bull; Tutorial &bull; Docs &bull; Playground","Croqtile is the first AI-native GPU kernel language. Every design decision -- from syntax to compiler diagnostics -- is made so that AI agents can write, tune, and ship production kernels autonomously. The result is a language that feels intuitive to a first-time programmer (tiles, pipelines, and warp roles read like pseudocode) yet gives experts single-site control over every hardware knob without coupling or hidden side effects."],"features":["Syntax-Context Co-Design. The syntax is engineered to maximize semantic density per token. Structural intent (tile shapes, pipeline depth, warp roles) is expressed directly rather than encoded in template parameters or…","Compiler-Harness Co-Design. The compiler is the other half of the agent's control loop. Every compilation is deterministic and returns in seconds -- not with a bare pass/fail, but with a structured diagnostic that names…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LancerLab/croqtile/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e7f61ca4d717c